<title>USA: TABLE - ITT Industries Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ITT Industries Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.68		    $0.56</p>
<p> Net			 82,600		   67,700</p>
<p> Revs		   2,250,900		2,241,200</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.05		    $0.89</p>
<p> Net			126,900		  107,700</p>
<p> Revs		not provided	   not provided</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Per share figures given are fully diluted.</p>
<p>Q2 1997 total sales from ongoing segments was $2.19 billion, up $45.4 million from Q2 1996. Six-month sales from ongoing segments was $4.3 billion, up $74.7 million from the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>Q2 1997 operating income was $157.2 million, up $5.1 million from Q2 1996. Six-month operating income was 260.5 million, up $3.3 million from 1996.</p>
</text>
